{"id": "DeexCR3P4dq", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"VOICE\" to get Fish Audio and build a voice agent that answers instantly.\n\nYou can now build a voice agent that answers in under a tenth of a second.\n\nIt's called Fish Audio.\n\nIt starts responding in about 90 milliseconds.\n\nThat is quick enough that the whole thing feels like a real conversation.\n\nInstead of a laggy one.\n\nSlow replies are what make most voice agents feel robotic.\n\nThat delay is what Fish Audio cuts down.\n\nThink of it like a phone call instead of sending voice notes back and forth.\n\nIt can also clone your voice from a ten second recording.\n\nAnd that clone speaks up to 83 languages.\n\nSo you can give your agent your own voice.\n\nAnd have it speak to people in their own language.\n\nYou can use it for customer support calls.\n\nOr for a personal assistant you talk to out loud.\n\nOr for narration in any language you need.\n\nOr for an app that talks to users.\n\nPlus there's an MCP.\n\nSo you can wire it straight into your Codex or your preferred platform.\n\nThe MCP lets your agent call it directly.\n\nYou connect it once and it works inside your setup.\n\n#aivoiceagent #fishaudio #aivoicecloning #voicegenerator #aiaudio   ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791995963, "like_count": 1295, "comment_count": 1412, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4169465236694144a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.617, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPnmyqQnshl06AUG0d9d5TDpL_NvYd2OIYl6HSs17BPbc9zPtxfqKUVe33Oc30I6yhziL-R5sR8XhwRxCTUvkM4Dd7YDHzlXZC-QjY.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Adq_jO3xQuxkW2R_wG4yp8lysQigEzG6K3wuTf6A3QF1JEPPFka2KThFsOukBhEovco&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=4elTfAhveC8Q7kNvwH